t></font></div>\r\n<div><font style=\"font-size:14.5px\"><font style=\"font-family:Nylas-Pro,Helvetica,&quot;Lucidia Grande&quot;,sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><font style=\"font-size:11px\">&gt; # Look at output for IO model WITH observer</font></font></font></font></div>\r\n<div><font style=\"font-size:14.5px\"><font style=\"font-family:Nylas-Pro,Helvetica,&quot;Lucidia Grande&quot;,sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><font style=\"font-size:11px\">&gt; # Note that &quot;Average primary p(0)&quot; and “Average secondary p(0)” estimates are\r\n different</font></font></font></font></div>\r\n<div><font style=\"font-size:14.5px\"><font style=\"font-family:Nylas-Pro,Helvetica,&quot;Lucidia Grande&quot;,sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><font style=\"font-size:11px\">&gt; # -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</font></font></font></font></div>\r\n<div><font style=\"font-size:14.5px\"><font style=\"font-family:Nylas-Pro,Helvetica,&quot;Lucidia Grande&quot;,sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><font style=\"font-size:11px\">&gt; io.fi.dist_obs</font></font></font></font></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><font style=\"font-size:14.5px\"><font style=\"font-family:Nylas-Pro,Helvetica,&quot;Lucidia Grande&quot;,sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><font style=\"font-size:11px\">Distance sampling analysis object</font></font></font></font></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><font style=\"font-size:14.5px\"><font style=\"font-family:Nylas-Pro,Helvetica,&quot;Lucidia Grande&quot;,sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><font style=\"font-size:11px\">Summary for </font></font></font></font><font style=\"font-size:14.5px\"><font style=\"font-family:Nylas-Pro,Helvetica,&quot;Lucidia Grande&quot;,sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><font style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(16,129,247)\"><a href=\