><a href=\"https://maps.google.com/?q=The%20Observatory%2C%20Buchanan%20Gardens%2C%20St%20Andrews%20KY16%209LZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://maps.google.com/?q%3DThe%2520Observatory%252C%2520Buchanan%2520Gardens%252C%2520St%2520Andrews%2520KY16%25209LZ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792473517542000&amp;usg=AOvVaw04Ukn--1NPZCcKaIjALnP0\">The Observatory, Buchanan Gardens, St Andrews KY16 9LZ</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<u></u></div></div>"
